# Fresh NEWWORLD. scripts/vob_layer_fixture.py puts its cube at
# (30213,5186,-15710), 300 cm along +X from START_GOTHIC2.
# Run twice with temporary OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT: --collision mesh and none.
# `pos` records native hero coordinates in events.jsonl before/after walking.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view nopfx
release all
goto pos 29913 5186 -15710
clear 1800
wait 1000
face 0
walkmode walk
cam follow 450 240 90
pos
shot vob-layer-start
press forward
wait 2000
pos
wait 2000
pos
release forward
wait 100
shot vob-layer-contact
wait 100
